{"questionId":"u02-s012-v011","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-ops","skillId":"fraction-complex-fraction-basic","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"水箱原有全箱容量的 [[frac:5|6]]，用掉全箱容量的 [[frac:1|4]]，又補入全箱容量的 [[frac:1|6]]。現在水量佔全箱容量的多少？","choices":["[[frac:5|12]]","[[frac:2|3]]","[[frac:3|4]]","1"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"依時間順序計算：[[frac:5|6]]－[[frac:1|4]]＋[[frac:1|6]]=[[frac:10|12]]－[[frac:3|12]]＋[[frac:2|12]]=[[frac:9|12]]=[[frac:3|4]]。","steps":["把三個分數通分為分母 12。","依序做減法與加法。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"[[frac:5|12]]","truth":false,"reason":"只做了前兩項且計算錯誤。"},{"choice":"[[frac:2|3]]","truth":false,"reason":"漏算補入的水量。"},{"choice":"[[frac:3|4]]","truth":true,"reason":"正確。"},{"choice":"1","truth":false,"reason":"把補水後誤認為裝滿。"}],"commonMistake":"忽略『又補入』，或把減法與加法符號看反。","concept":"同一基準量的增加與減少可直接做分數加減。","tags":["數與量","基準量","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"90","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-add-subtract","fraction-multiply-divide","fraction-mixed-number"],"authoringIntent":"在同一基準量下處理連續增減。","literacyContextNecessity":"需辨認三個分數都以全箱容量為共同基準，並按事件順序運算。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"c538a359217624aca4d7901f217d4599e7b5c8042d8f96a3b5b47e70c3750008"}
{"questionId":"u02-s012-v012","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-ops","skillId":"fraction-complex-fraction-basic","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"一本書有 240 頁。第一天讀全書的 [[frac:1|4]]，第二天讀剩下頁數的 [[frac:2|5]]。兩天後還剩多少頁？","choices":["84 頁","96 頁","120 頁","108 頁"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"第一天讀 240×[[frac:1|4]]=60 頁，剩 180 頁；第二天讀 180×[[frac:2|5]]=72 頁，所以還剩 180−72=108 頁。","steps":["先求第一天後的剩餘頁數。","第二天的 [[frac:2|5]] 是以剩餘 180 頁為基準。","最後求第二天讀完後的剩餘頁數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"84 頁","truth":false,"reason":"把第二天誤用全書 240 頁為基準。"},{"choice":"96 頁","truth":false,"reason":"第二天讀取頁數或減法錯誤。"},{"choice":"120 頁","truth":false,"reason":"只算第一天讀完後的一部分。"},{"choice":"108 頁","truth":true,"reason":"正確。"}],"commonMistake":"把第二天的比例仍乘以全書頁數。","concept":"連續比例要注意每一步的基準量。","tags":["數與量","閱讀進度","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"120","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-add-subtract","fraction-multiply-divide","fraction-mixed-number"],"authoringIntent":"處理基準量改變的兩步分數情境。","literacyContextNecessity":"第二天的比例以第一天後的剩餘量為基準，不能直接把兩個比例相加。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"8720b2774c6d6ad5a068878dc4aebf86b52a7beabb2305efbbe31ba8871458d9"}
